## 🧩 Core Differentiator Features

### 1. “Extract table X from page Y”
- Users define what to extract — not the AI guessing.
- This allows pinpoint accuracy and avoids irrelevant data.

### 2. “Using my saved logic”
- Define rules once: page, table, headers, skip rows, filter by keywords.
- Save logic to reapply every month.

### 3. “Repeat this for 300 files”
- Most tools fail here.
- Your tool applies templates in batch with consistent output and zero manual rework.

