## 🧪 Ideal UX Flow

1. Upload a PDF
2. Auto-detect tables (AI)
3. Click to select or override
4. Define:
   - Header row
   - Columns to include/exclude
   - Filters (e.g., remove totals, blank rows)
5. Save template
6. Upload batch
7. Apply template, preview if needed
8. Export Excel files

